- **`feat/health-contracts-cuidabot`** health vertical — rebase onto this consolidated `main` (its `HealthConsentRegistry` overlaps the new `ConsentRegistry`).

> Note: `midnight-doctor` flags the `wallet-sdk` subpackages as "spanning majors 3 and 4." This is inherent to the official `@midnight-ntwrk/wallet-sdk@1.1.0` barrel (it depends on `facade ^4.x` + `shielded ^3.x`) for this SDK generation — a known false-positive, identical in the proven `dpo2u-midnight-agents` deploy.

